    "anchor": "24.28",
    "summary": "While attacks from **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)** weapons resolve, the active player may, as the Allocation Order step of **[Save Rolls](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls)** (05.03) starts, pick an allocation group holding a **CHARACTER** model that at least 1 attacking model can see.\n\nThat group stays the current allocation group until those attacks finish or it is **destroyed**, whichever comes first.",
